7
00:00:29.808 --> 00:00:31.577
The question may arise:

8
00:00:31.577 --> 00:00:33.423
what is the purpose

9
00:00:33.423 --> 00:00:35.808
of working for someone

10
00:00:35.808 --> 00:00:37.423
who is not even attached

11
00:00:37.423 --> 00:00:39.654
to the results of their work?

12
00:00:39.654 --> 00:00:41.615
Lord Krishna is answering

13
00:00:41.615 --> 00:00:44.615
this very question in this verse.

14
00:00:49.154 --> 00:00:51.231
Many times, such a question

15
00:00:51.231 --> 00:00:53.462
naturally arises

16
00:00:53.462 --> 00:00:56.423
that when there is no attachment to the fruit of action,

17
00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:59.423
then why even do that action?

18
00:00:59.654 --> 00:01:02.000
Dispelling this misconception,

19
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:02.615
Lord Krishna

20
00:01:02.615 --> 00:01:04.115
is addressing the purpose

21
00:01:04.115 --> 00:01:04.846
behind the actions

22
00:01:04.846 --> 00:01:07.808
of a yogi.

23
00:01:07.808 --> 00:01:11.577
He is saying that a yogi certainly performs actions with the body, mind,

24
00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:13.731
intellect, and senses,

25
00:01:13.731 --> 00:01:15.692
but their purpose is

26
00:01:15.692 --> 00:01:19.231
purification,

27
00:01:19.615 --> 00:01:22.846
not personal gain or material success.

28
00:01:23.731 --> 00:01:24.385
Now the question

29
00:01:24.385 --> 00:01:25.654
may arise

30
00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:28.654
as to why purification is necessary

31
00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:29.654
for a yogi?

32
00:01:29.654 --> 00:01:32.654
Most humans consider themselves to be the body.

33
00:01:33.115 --> 00:01:35.615
This thinking is completely inappropriate.

34
00:01:35.615 --> 00:01:37.154
If you want to know

35
00:01:37.154 --> 00:01:38.885
your true existence,

36
00:01:38.885 --> 00:01:41.115
then purification is necessary.

37
00:01:41.115 --> 00:01:43.154
This verse also shows

38
00:01:43.154 --> 00:01:45.192
that purification does not happen only through the mind

39
00:01:45.192 --> 00:01:47.615
or intellect,

40
00:01:47.615 --> 00:01:50.615
but also through the senses.

41
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.231
Even though the mind may sometimes wander,

42
00:01:54.615 --> 00:01:56.308
when the senses are engaged

43
00:01:56.308 --> 00:01:58.385
in designated duties,

44
00:01:58.385 --> 00:01:58.769
it

45
00:01:58.769 --> 00:02:02.000
helps purify the soul.

46
00:02:02.654 --> 00:02:05.769
Lord Krishna is emphasizing

47
00:02:06.269 --> 00:02:07.231
that spiritual

48
00:02:07.231 --> 00:02:11.000
progress is not just a mental exercise,

49
00:02:11.308 --> 00:02:14.500
but it is to completely absorb the body and senses

50
00:02:14.615 --> 00:02:17.654
in such activities

51
00:02:18.077 --> 00:02:21.077
that are also in accordance with the spiritual goal.

52
00:02:21.269 --> 00:02:23.269
In this spiritual progress,

53
00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:25.346
you not only have to attain freedom

54
00:02:25.346 --> 00:02:26.615
from your desires,

55
00:02:26.615 --> 00:02:29.577
but also have to engage your body and senses

56
00:02:29.577 --> 00:02:31.808
in the devotion of God.

57
00:02:31.808 --> 00:02:35.385
By doing so, a person purifies oneself

58
00:02:35.692 --> 00:02:38.462
and reaches near the supreme goal

59
00:02:38.462 --> 00:02:39.346
of liberation.

60
00:02:44.538 --> 00:02:47.423
Are you working for personal gain

61
00:02:47.423 --> 00:02:49.769
or the enjoyment

62
00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:52.231
of results?

63
00:02:52.231 --> 00:02:55.654
Or are you working with the aim of purifying your heart

64
00:02:56.192 --> 00:02:59.000
and awakening your consciousness

65
00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.846
from selfishness

66
00:03:01.846 --> 00:03:04.846
to selflessness?

67
00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:09.269
Is the fruit behind the action

68
00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:12.269
your biggest motivation?

69
00:03:13.615 --> 00:03:15.692
You may say that

70
00:03:15.692 --> 00:03:19.077
it is the fruit that motivates you,

71
00:03:19.692 --> 00:03:22.692
otherwise why even do the action.

72
00:03:24.154 --> 00:03:27.192
I want to tell you

73
00:03:28.462 --> 00:03:31.462
that such thinking is inappropriate.

74
00:03:32.077 --> 00:03:34.154
When your actions are driven

75
00:03:34.154 --> 00:03:37.154
by the desire for personal enjoyment,

76
00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:42.462
you get entangled in the results,

77
00:03:42.462 --> 00:03:46.154
whether you achieve success or failure in them.

78
00:03:47.308 --> 00:03:50.308
This attachment to results binds you

79
00:03:50.615 --> 00:03:53.615
to the material world,

80
00:03:54.115 --> 00:03:58.423
which is why you consider yourself to be the body

81
00:03:59.231 --> 00:04:02.231
or mind,

82
00:04:02.269 --> 00:04:05.192
which is inappropriate.

83
00:04:05.192 --> 00:04:06.115
For example,

84
00:04:07.231 --> 00:04:09.423
when you work,

85
00:04:09.423 --> 00:04:12.423
don't do it just for the salary,

86
00:04:12.577 --> 00:04:14.115
but do it to develop qualities

87
00:04:14.115 --> 00:04:15.077
like patience, perseverance,

88
00:04:15.077 --> 00:04:18.077
and humility.

89
00:04:18.654 --> 00:04:21.346
See your family responsibilities

90
00:04:21.346 --> 00:04:22.885
as opportunities

91
00:04:22.885 --> 00:04:23.692
to practice love, compassion,

92
00:04:23.692 --> 00:04:26.808
and sacrifice.

93
00:04:27.692 --> 00:04:30.885
Even when you are doing nothing,

94
00:04:31.538 --> 00:04:35.000
even at such times, engage your actions

95
00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:37.731
in the attainment of your

96
00:04:37.731 --> 00:04:39.769
spiritual goals.

97
00:04:39.769 --> 00:04:42.500
By working without attachment,

98
00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:45.808
you purify your mind and heart,

99
00:04:46.538 --> 00:04:49.538
gradually moving away from selfish desires

100
00:04:49.538 --> 00:04:51.231
and closer to your true,

101
00:04:51.231 --> 00:04:54.231
selfless nature.

102
00:04:54.692 --> 00:04:55.731
In such a situation,

103
00:04:55.731 --> 00:04:58.808
free from the burden of expectations and ego,

104
00:04:59.615 --> 00:05:01.038
your actions

105
00:05:01.038 --> 00:05:04.038
are dedicated to that Supreme Soul.

106
00:05:04.885 --> 00:05:07.885
This path demands self-reflection.

107
00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.538
Ask yourself:

108
00:05:10.538 --> 00:05:11.615
What is the reason

109
00:05:12.885 --> 00:05:15.885
behind what I am doing?

110
00:05:16.038 --> 00:05:17.077
Am I

111
00:05:17.077 --> 00:05:20.077
seeking personal satisfaction,

112
00:05:20.231 --> 00:05:22.500
or am I using this opportunity

113
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.500
while purifying my consciousness

114
00:05:25.731 --> 00:05:28.885
for my spiritual development?

115
00:05:30.462 --> 00:05:33.462
So, I leave this question to you:

116
00:05:34.154 --> 00:05:36.308
In your life today,

117
00:05:36.308 --> 00:05:37.615
are your actions driven

118
00:05:37.615 --> 00:05:40.615
by the desire for personal gain,

119
00:05:41.115 --> 00:05:43.731
or are you truly working in the direction

120
00:05:43.731 --> 00:05:44.615
of purifying your heart

121
00:05:44.615 --> 00:05:48.192
and soul?

122
00:05:49.462 --> 00:05:52.462
Think about it.

123
00:05:55.769 --> 00:05:58.192
In today's time,

124
00:05:58.192 --> 00:06:01.192
it is very important to think

125
00:06:01.731 --> 00:06:04.154
about what kind of

126
00:06:04.154 --> 00:06:07.154
thoughts are entering your mind.

127
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.000
The mind is a garden -

128
00:06:11.462 --> 00:06:14.808
what you sow is what you reap.

129
00:06:15.577 --> 00:06:18.192
Ask yourself,

130
00:06:18.192 --> 00:06:21.192
what kind of seeds are you sowing?

131
00:06:22.538 --> 00:06:24.423
Are the thoughts coming into the mind

132
00:06:24.423 --> 00:06:27.038
elevating and

133
00:06:27.038 --> 00:06:30.192
purifying your consciousness?

134
00:06:30.192 --> 00:06:34.269
Or are they polluting it while obstructing

135
00:06:34.308 --> 00:06:35.115
your spiritual

136
00:06:36.538 --> 00:06:38.615
growth?

137
00:06:38.615 --> 00:06:41.000
What kind of conversations do you have

138
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.000
in your social environment?

139
00:06:44.577 --> 00:06:47.231
The kind of discussions you absorb

140
00:06:47.231 --> 00:06:50.231
from social media,

141
00:06:50.615 --> 00:06:51.885
such thoughts

142
00:06:51.885 --> 00:06:55.000
affect your mind.

143
00:06:55.538 --> 00:06:58.538
Are these conversations and influences

144
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.577
focused on positivity, wisdom,

145
00:07:02.577 --> 00:07:05.577
and high ideals?

146
00:07:06.385 --> 00:07:09.269
Or are they based on negativity,

147
00:07:09.269 --> 00:07:12.615
materialism, and distractions

148
00:07:13.154 --> 00:07:15.038
that take you away

149
00:07:15.038 --> 00:07:18.038
from the spiritual path?

150
00:07:18.115 --> 00:07:21.577
Are these discussions and talks positive?

151
00:07:22.577 --> 00:07:24.769
Or are these negative things related to materialism

152
00:07:24.769 --> 00:07:28.846
that are misleading you?

153
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.500
It is natural to get caught up in the noise of the world,

154
00:07:33.577 --> 00:07:36.346
where mostly irrelevant

155
00:07:36.346 --> 00:07:39.346
and superficial discussions prevail.

156
00:07:41.115 --> 00:07:42.692
Over time,

157
00:07:42.692 --> 00:07:45.692
these negative or meaningless thoughts

158
00:07:46.308 --> 00:07:49.423
can blur and weaken your discernment

159
00:07:49.808 --> 00:07:53.269
and resolve, and thereby

160
00:07:54.385 --> 00:07:55.423
take you away

161
00:07:55.423 --> 00:07:59.115
from your true purpose.

162
00:08:00.269 --> 00:08:02.500
Ask yourself:

163
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.500
Are my thoughts beneficial

164
00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.154
for my spiritual growth?

165
00:08:09.154 --> 00:08:12.154
Do they align with my selfless, compassionate,

166
00:08:12.231 --> 00:08:16.308
and true nature?

167
00:08:17.385 --> 00:08:20.692
Or are those thoughts filling my mind with desires

168
00:08:21.385 --> 00:08:23.885
or ambitions,

169
00:08:23.885 --> 00:08:27.538
which bind me to the material world?

170
00:08:29.115 --> 00:08:30.577
If you find that

171
00:08:30.577 --> 00:08:34.500
your mental activities are polluting you

172
00:08:34.538 --> 00:08:37.615
instead of purifying,

173
00:08:39.115 --> 00:08:41.308
then it's time

174
00:08:41.308 --> 00:08:43.346
for a change.

175
00:08:43.346 --> 00:08:45.462
Start bringing

176
00:08:45.462 --> 00:08:47.731
spiritual discussions into your social interactions

177
00:08:47.731 --> 00:08:50.731
wherever possible.

178
00:08:51.192 --> 00:08:53.654
Encourage conversations centered around higher values,

179
00:08:53.654 --> 00:08:55.500
life's purpose,

180
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.500
and the search for truth.

181
00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.769
By doing so,

182
00:08:58.769 --> 00:09:01.423
you will not only purify your own mind,

183
00:09:01.423 --> 00:09:02.615
but also

184
00:09:02.615 --> 00:09:05.769
uplift those around you.

185
00:09:06.577 --> 00:09:09.462
You will create an environment

186
00:09:09.462 --> 00:09:12.615
where the mind is being nourished with positivity, wisdom,

187
00:09:12.769 --> 00:09:16.385
and spiritual growth.

188
00:09:22.308 --> 00:09:24.577
In your professional life,

189
00:09:24.577 --> 00:09:25.462
you need to work

190
00:09:25.462 --> 00:09:28.462
at various levels –

191
00:09:28.654 --> 00:09:31.308
such as through your body, mind,

192
00:09:31.308 --> 00:09:34.000
and intellect.

193
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.538
Each of these aspects also underlines

194
00:09:36.538 --> 00:09:39.538
your attitude towards work.

195
00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:43.462
Body, mind, and intellect are those aspects of your existence

196
00:09:43.462 --> 00:09:44.808
that indicate

197
00:09:44.808 --> 00:09:46.462
your attitude

198
00:09:46.462 --> 00:09:49.462
towards work.

199
00:09:49.654 --> 00:09:50.731
To achieve your excellent

200
00:09:50.731 --> 00:09:52.731
professional performance,

201
00:09:52.731 --> 00:09:55.115
you will have to establish harmony

202
00:09:55.115 --> 00:09:57.462
in all these aspects.

203
00:09:57.462 --> 00:09:59.385
You will have to ensure

204
00:09:59.385 --> 00:10:02.692
that your physical actions, mental focus,

205
00:10:02.692 --> 00:10:04.577
and intellectual efforts

206
00:10:04.577 --> 00:10:06.154
are guided by

207
00:10:06.154 --> 00:10:08.885
the same motivation.

208
00:10:08.885 --> 00:10:11.808
This will increase your efficiency

209
00:10:11.808 --> 00:10:13.346
and you will also achieve

210
00:10:13.346 --> 00:10:15.577
your excellent form.

211
00:10:15.577 --> 00:10:19.538
Physical actions and fulfillment of responsibilities

212
00:10:20.885 --> 00:10:23.038
are only the external expressions

213
00:10:23.038 --> 00:10:27.346
of your professional endeavor,

214
00:10:27.385 --> 00:10:30.731
i.e., only a part of the whole work.

215
00:10:32.115 --> 00:10:34.692
To make these actions truly effective,

216
00:10:34.692 --> 00:10:38.538
they must also be supported by the right mental attitude

217
00:10:38.885 --> 00:10:42.269
and intellectual clarity.

218
00:10:44.269 --> 00:10:45.192
When your mind

219
00:10:45.192 --> 00:10:48.269
is focused and intellect is sharp,

220
00:10:49.154 --> 00:10:53.192
your physical actions move towards more purposeful

221
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.615
and meaningful results.

222
00:10:57.885 --> 00:10:59.808
Consider,

223
00:10:59.808 --> 00:11:02.423
there is a businessman

224
00:11:02.423 --> 00:11:03.769
who does his work

225
00:11:03.769 --> 00:11:06.769
with full effort,

226
00:11:07.577 --> 00:11:10.154
but due to his mind wandering,

227
00:11:10.154 --> 00:11:13.154
he is mentally somewhere else.

228
00:11:13.808 --> 00:11:15.808
Such a businessman's work

229
00:11:15.808 --> 00:11:18.808
is physically complete,

230
00:11:19.346 --> 00:11:23.000
but there is a lack of energy and purpose in this effort,

231
00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.154
which makes his endeavor

232
00:11:25.154 --> 00:11:27.577
unimpressive.

233
00:11:27.577 --> 00:11:30.577
On the other hand,

234
00:11:30.769 --> 00:11:32.308
if that same person is focused

235
00:11:32.308 --> 00:11:33.385
on his work with complete mental attention,

236
00:11:36.154 --> 00:11:39.154
carefully planning,

237
00:11:39.346 --> 00:11:41.500
and applying his intellect

238
00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.731
to solve problems –

239
00:11:43.731 --> 00:11:47.192
then surely his effort moves towards a positive

240
00:11:47.192 --> 00:11:50.192
outcome.

241
00:11:50.385 --> 00:11:52.115
But

242
00:11:52.115 --> 00:11:55.615
just being proficient is not enough;

243
00:11:56.231 --> 00:11:59.192
your thoughts and actions must also be guided

244
00:11:59.192 --> 00:12:02.308
by a desire

245
00:12:03.154 --> 00:12:06.154
that seeks to make not only your work excellent,

246
00:12:06.308 --> 00:12:09.692
but also you

247
00:12:09.692 --> 00:12:11.538
as a person.

248
00:12:12.577 --> 00:12:15.077
Every day ask yourself:

249
00:12:15.077 --> 00:12:18.077
How can I establish harmony

250
00:12:18.192 --> 00:12:21.462
in my body, mind, and intellect today?

251
00:12:22.423 --> 00:12:25.654
How can I use my work

252
00:12:25.846 --> 00:12:30.077
as a tool for personal growth

253
00:12:30.077 --> 00:12:31.115
and self-improvement?